==================================================
11. ASSESSMENT TIMER
==================================================

Use a simple countdown timer.

Example:

Chapter Assessment
Time Remaining: 05:00

The timer should start when the assessment begins.

If time reaches zero:

Automatically submit the assessment.

CRITICAL:

The current timer state and answers must be persisted.

If the page refreshes during an assessment, restore the assessment state instead of starting a completely new test.

If technically appropriate, store an absolute assessment end timestamp rather than simply decrementing a counter in React state.

Example:

assessmentStartedAt
assessmentEndsAt

On reload:

remainingTime = assessmentEndsAt - currentTime

This prevents the timer from resetting when the browser is refreshed.

