30. NO DATA LOSS
==================================================

This is one of the highest-priority requirements.

The application should never lose progress because of:

- refresh
- accidental browser closure
- navigation
- temporary connection loss
- logout

Use autosave aggressively.

For assessment answers, save immediately on every answer selection.

For video playback position, save periodically where technically possible.

Use a versioned storage schema so future updates do not corrupt existing local data.

Gracefully handle corrupted local storage by showing a safe recovery option rather than crashing.

==================================================
