==================================================

The app should be as resilient as possible.

Assessment state should remain available offline after the application has loaded.

Use local state persistence.

Do not require a backend connection simply to preserve assessment answers.

Video playback may require internet depending on the Google Drive hosting method.

If Google Drive is unavailable, show a clean message rather than crashing the application.

